---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead
      title="Minecraft version history"
      description="In 2025, Mojang announced a new versioning system. Some people are upset because it breaks 15 years of continuity. But what if we had the new system all along?"
    />
    <slot name="head" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>Minecraft version history: in a new light</h1>
      <p>
        In 2026, Minecraft <a
          href="https://www.minecraft.net/en-us/article/minecraft-new-version-numbering-system"
          >will start numbering versions by year</a
        >. Some people are upset because it breaks 15 years of continuity. <b
          >But what if we had the new system all along?</b
        >
      </p>
      <p>
        The list of blocks, items, and entities is not comprehensive, omitting
        some stuff that was obviously added together (wool colours, armour
        materials, shaped variants, etc.)
      </p>
      <p>The spawn egg represents added mobs, not the actual spawn egg item.</p>
      <p>The chart uses modern textures throughout.</p>
      <article style="display: grid;">
        <Row label="2009">
          <VersionCard
            title="Minecraft Classic"
            description="Early block palette, limited world size, mobs, health bar, (first) multiplayer"
            icons={icons.classic}
          />
        </Row>
        <Row label="2010">
          <VersionCard
            title="Minecraft Indev & Infdev"
            description="Crafting, inventory, infinite terrain, dynamic lighting, food, clouds"
            icons={icons.indev}
          />
          <VersionCard
            title="Minecraft Alpha"
            description="Multiplayer, the Nether, biomes"
            icons={icons.alpha}
          />
        </Row>
        <Row label="2011">
          <VersionCard
            title="Minecraft Beta"
            description="Skipping the night, weather"
            icons={icons.beta}
          />
          <VersionCard
            title="Adventure Update"
            description="Hunger, sprinting, enchanting, brewing, the End, mineshafts, villages"
            icons={icons.release}
          />
        </Row>
        <Row label="2012">
          <!-- <VersionCard title="12.1" icons={icons.v12_1} /> -->
          <VersionCard
            version="12.1-12.2"
            title=""
            description="Spawn eggs, jungle, plank types"
            icons={icons.v12_2}
          />
          <VersionCard
            version="12.3"
            title=""
            description="Trading, desert pyramids, jungle temples"
            icons={icons.v12_3}
          />
          <VersionCard
            version="12.4"
            title="Pretty Scary Update"
            description="Wither, instamining, enchanted books"
            icons={icons.v12_4}
          />
        </Row>
        <Row label="2013">
          <VersionCard
            version="13.1"
            title="Redstone Update"
            description="Redstone components, quartz"
            icons={icons.v13_1}
          />
          <VersionCard
            version="13.2"
            title="Horse Update"
            description="Horses, terracotta, baby zombies"
            icons={icons.v13_2}
          />
          <VersionCard
            version="13.3"
            title="The Update that Changed the World"
            description="Mesa, savannah, ice spikes, new world gen"
            icons={icons.v13_3}
          />
        </Row>
        <Row label="2014">
          <VersionCard
            version="14.1"
            title="Bountiful Update"
            description="Ocean monument, world border, spectator mode"
            icons={icons.v14_1}
          />
        </Row>
        <Row label="2015" />
        <Row label="2016">
          <VersionCard
            version="16.1"
            title="Combat Update"
            description="Gliding, off-hand, outer End islands, igloos"
            icons={icons.v16_1}
          />
          <VersionCard
            version="16.2"
            title="Frostburn Update"
            description="Fossils, auto-jump"
            icons={icons.v16_2}
          />
          <VersionCard
            version="16.3"
